WEBVTT

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:07.690
Recently, it's become popular to distribute bootlegged TV shows.

00:00:07.690 --> 00:00:14.410
If you don't have the rights-holder's permission, distributing bootlegs via the internet or otherwise...

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:16.990
...is prohibited by law!

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:18.330
Please remember that...

00:00:29.380 --> 00:00:31.380
Christmas...

00:00:32.510 --> 00:00:34.300
Christmas...

00:00:34.630 --> 00:00:35.680
All done!

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:37.390
What's keeping you?

00:00:37.390 --> 00:00:38.930
Don't keep Iono waiting.

00:00:38.930 --> 00:00:41.060
Okay!

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.430
Don't forget to put on a coat.

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:44.640
It's cold today.

00:00:44.640 --> 00:00:46.690
Sure thing, brother!

00:00:46.690 --> 00:00:48.310
Don't snuggle so close to me...

00:00:48.310 --> 00:00:51.360
But it's chilly!

00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:53.950
It's the parallel world's famous annual event.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.320
Whether they're children or adults,

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:58.200
singles or couples,

00:00:58.200 --> 00:01:00.290
everyone awaits the big celebration.

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:02.830
And that is: Christmas!

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:07.750
Iono, where should we get
this year's Christmas cake?

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:10.880
How about we make one ourselves?

00:01:10.880 --> 00:01:12.760
Seriously?

00:01:12.760 --> 00:01:17.550
Well, they've actually been teaching us how to bake in class.

00:01:17.550 --> 00:01:21.680
That's awesome, Iono!
You really can cook after all!

00:01:21.680 --> 00:01:23.470
I guess.

00:01:22.350 --> 00:01:24.560
Those girls have it rough.

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:28.770
Just to let you know, Life Core doesn't have Christmas.

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:34.740
Kiseki wa genjitsu no tonari ni aru

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:34.740
Miracles are right beside reality

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.820
Kanarazu aru

00:01:34.740 --> 00:01:37.820
They're there for sure

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:49.170
Chiisana tameiki shinpai dakara

00:01:43.580 --> 00:01:49.170
I heave a tiny sigh because I'm worried

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:55.090
Ushiro sugata mimamotteirunda yo

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:55.090
From behind you, I'm watching over you

00:01:55.420 --> 00:02:01.010
Kirai dattara konna koto iwanai yo

00:01:55.420 --> 00:02:01.010
I wouldn't be saying this if I hated you

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:07.190
Kitto hito wa hitori janai

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:07.190
I know it must be true that no man is an island

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:08.600
Hitori janai

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:08.600
You're not alone

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:14.900
Tatoeba sotto yubisaki ni fureru omoi

00:02:09.310 --> 00:02:14.900
For example, if you gently brush those hopes with your fingertips

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:20.820
Tatoeba taisetsu na toki wo wasurenaide

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:20.820
For example, if you never forget these precious times

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:26.750
Kakato wo motto sukoshi dake takaku agete

00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:26.750
I'll boost you up, just a little higher

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:32.750
Mieru yo ano ko no hitomi ni utsuru hikari

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:32.750
Look and see the light reflecting in her eyes

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:38.630
ENERGY wa sekai no zenbu ni michiteru

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:38.630
Filling up the whole world with energy

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:46.390
Ima dake wa chikara wo kashite ageru yo

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:46.390
Just for now, I'll lend my strength to you

00:03:02.110 --> 00:03:04.780
Present!?

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.780
Present!?

00:03:13.840 --> 00:03:16.800
Oh no, depression level just rose to C.

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.760
But...

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:29.730
Sorry about this.

00:03:46.490 --> 00:03:47.910
Now's my chance!

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.210
Charge!

00:03:50.210 --> 00:03:52.170
Shocking!

00:03:52.170 --> 00:03:56.250
We're giving away presents!
Come one, come all!

00:03:56.710 --> 00:03:58.210
Mission accomplished!

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.840
What are you yapping about?

00:03:59.840 --> 00:04:01.670
Did you see? Did you just see that?

00:04:01.670 --> 00:04:03.470
I was amazing, wasn't I?

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:06.390
I push, fly in, and charge!

00:04:06.390 --> 00:04:08.310
Yeah, yeah, incredible.

00:04:08.310 --> 00:04:11.390
If you're so amazing, you should get back to work.

00:04:11.390 --> 00:04:14.230
What's with you, party-pooper...

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.360
Idiot! Do you know what the situation is like right now?

00:04:17.360 --> 00:04:20.820
Targets that need to be charged are popping up non-stop!

00:04:20.820 --> 00:04:24.530
I don't even have the time fool around with you!

00:04:25.530 --> 00:04:27.620
You heard me. Let's go.

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:31.870
Merry bear-bear-mas, merry bear-bear-mas!

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.670
A present, huh?

00:04:33.670 --> 00:04:34.870
Plug!

00:04:34.870 --> 00:04:38.040
Yeah, yeah, I'm coming!

00:04:38.550 --> 00:04:40.000
Welcome!

00:04:40.420 --> 00:04:42.340
Smoking or non-smoking?

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:43.930
Non-smoking, please.

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:46.300
Then please take the open seats right over there.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:47.430
Welco-

00:04:48.970 --> 00:04:50.350
Leakage Ladies.

00:04:50.350 --> 00:04:51.720
Long time no see.

00:04:51.720 --> 00:04:54.560
May we have a moment, Sentou Oumi?

00:04:59.610 --> 00:05:03.530
<i>How should I put it... They're totally different from Plug and Alesta...</i>

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:07.660
<i>Totally mature from top to bottom, and then some.</i>

00:05:08.410 --> 00:05:11.240
<i>And those office-type uniforms they wear... </i>

00:05:11.240 --> 00:05:15.080
<i>They're just so damn hot...</i>

00:05:19.340 --> 00:05:20.340
Something the matter?

00:05:20.340 --> 00:05:21.500
No, it's nothing!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.090
There's no need to be so nervous.

00:05:24.090 --> 00:05:27.970
Oh, that's... good. I think.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:31.260
While examining the time frame of the stolen electricity incident,

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:33.140
we discovered an unusual presence.

00:05:33.140 --> 00:05:35.350
A... presence?

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.850
Allow us to review the sequence of events.

00:05:37.850 --> 00:05:49.870
ELECTRICITY

00:05:39.230 --> 00:05:47.240
The electricity used to charge a target in the parallel world is secretly stolen.

00:05:44.110 --> 00:05:49.870
NEGATIVE

00:05:48.490 --> 00:05:55.500
Thus, the larger the number of targets needing to be charged, the more electricity can be stolen.

00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:59.460
That's why the perpetrators are making sure that the number of targets keeps increasing.

00:05:59.460 --> 00:06:02.170
They increase the number of targets that need to be charged?

00:06:02.170 --> 00:06:04.050
They're the exact opposite of Charging Ladies.

00:06:04.050 --> 00:06:07.300
They steal life energy from parallel world humans...

00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:11.140
...and convert it to their own.

00:06:11.140 --> 00:06:13.890
The only record of these beings is from 100 years ago.

00:06:13.890 --> 00:06:20.020
The legendary beings with this special ability are known as Electricity Discharge Ladies.

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:21.980
Electricity Discharge Ladies?

00:06:22.360 --> 00:06:26.860
You parallels should consider them a life-threatening existence.

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:29.070
So be very wary.

00:06:30.200 --> 00:06:34.660
Have there been any strange occurrences around you of late?

00:06:35.660 --> 00:06:41.210
Like a classmate getting depressed for no apparent reason.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:45.170
It doesn't matter how mundane the details may be.

00:06:45.170 --> 00:06:50.470
Please reply to us through this address if you notice anything.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:52.640
Alright.

00:06:52.680 --> 00:06:58.140
Name: Reika Galvani

00:06:54.760 --> 00:06:57.270
Can I ask one question?

00:06:57.270 --> 00:06:58.100
What is it?

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.560
Why are you letting me to know something like this?

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:03.060
What do you mean?

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:08.860
Though I can see Charging Ladies, I'm not a detective.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:13.830
It's not that I'm saying I won't help...

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:18.250
I just feel sort of awkward because of what happened between us last time.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.370
So you see...

00:07:21.960 --> 00:07:26.090
It's just that we're personally interested in you...

00:07:26.880 --> 00:07:29.090
Were you expecting that?

00:07:33.090 --> 00:07:35.510
Farewell, Sentou Oumi.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:43.480
Kuran, what were you thinking, teasing him like that?

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:46.480
I wasn't teasing him at all.

00:07:46.480 --> 00:07:50.070
He really is interesting, you know.

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:54.780
If I recall correctly, wasn't it you who suggested that kind of approach?

00:07:54.780 --> 00:07:56.370
Did I now?

00:07:57.290 --> 00:07:58.830
Yes, you did.

00:08:05.630 --> 00:08:08.250
It sure was a tiring day.

00:08:08.250 --> 00:08:12.340
But, why does it get so busy this time of year?

00:08:12.340 --> 00:08:15.970
Is it because of that "Christmas" thing?

00:08:15.970 --> 00:08:18.970
I wouldn't know, go ask the people in the parallel world.

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:21.560
But it sounds fun with all that partying.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:23.560
I would relax and goof off a lot!

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:27.020
That'd be nice! There's also exchanging of presents, or something.

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:29.360
I would want a paid leave!

00:08:29.360 --> 00:08:30.820
Go beg the Captain, then.

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:35.910
<i>Present, huh? If I give one...</i>

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.410
<i>Where did that just come from?!</i>

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:42.120
<i>Get a grip.</i>

00:08:42.120 --> 00:08:44.870
<i>Because, Sentou is...</i>

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:54.260
<i>Sentou is...</i>

00:08:54.260 --> 00:08:56.390
<i>I'm thankful for that.</i>

00:08:56.390 --> 00:08:59.930
<i>That's why I intend to stay by her side.</i>

00:08:59.930 --> 00:09:04.560
Because of her, we can still live our lives in this world.

00:09:05.770 --> 00:09:06.860
What's up, Plug?

00:09:07.980 --> 00:09:09.270
Nothing, really!

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:11.990
Nothing, huh? Why so nervous, then?

00:09:11.990 --> 00:09:13.860
Don't tell us, you...

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.070
It's not what you're thinking.

00:09:15.070 --> 00:09:16.700
Spill the beans or else!

00:09:16.700 --> 00:09:18.490
What happened to asking nicely?

00:09:18.490 --> 00:09:20.870
What about you, Alesta?

00:09:21.950 --> 00:09:23.660
Other than bothering Plug...

00:09:23.660 --> 00:09:25.500
what are you girls doing?

00:09:26.080 --> 00:09:29.290
Now's not the time to be worried over trivial things.

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:30.460
Got it?

00:09:32.210 --> 00:09:33.920
Whatever you say.

00:09:34.550 --> 00:09:35.680
I'm leaving now.

00:09:37.090 --> 00:09:38.680
Bye bye!

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:11.460
Look at the flower!

00:10:12.380 --> 00:10:16.260
Whoa, a flower in a dump like this.

00:10:16.260 --> 00:10:17.680
Isn't that, like, awesome?

00:10:17.680 --> 00:10:20.300
Yeah, I'm like, so touched.

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:23.260
Life is like, so completely awesome!

00:10:23.260 --> 00:10:24.310
Exactly.

00:10:24.310 --> 00:10:27.520
This totally transcends the greed of mankind and stuff.

00:10:27.850 --> 00:10:29.850
It totally like, gives you courage.

00:10:29.850 --> 00:10:32.230
I feel like I can do anything right now, ya know?

00:10:35.990 --> 00:10:37.700
A present of courage.

00:10:37.700 --> 00:10:39.530
Thankies!

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.870
Man, I feel wiped out...

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:52.290
Bummer, I don't even feel like moving...

00:11:08.180 --> 00:11:09.770
Merry Christmas!

00:11:14.520 --> 00:11:18.150
Looks like today is going to be a great day!

00:11:18.150 --> 00:11:20.610
Maybe this is my reward for getting up so early for a change?

00:11:20.610 --> 00:11:22.120
Silly girl!

00:11:22.120 --> 00:11:25.490
Why would your entire day be good just because you woke up early, idiot!

00:11:25.490 --> 00:11:30.620
That's not true, there's a saying that goes, "the early bird is the third-rate actress."

00:11:30.620 --> 00:11:34.960
Moron! You're supposed to say, "the early bird catches the worm," you fool!

00:11:34.960 --> 00:11:38.170
Owie... Bitch, manhandling me is a no-no!

00:11:38.170 --> 00:11:42.510
If you were a real magical girl of love and justice you would have dodged it, knucklehead!

00:11:42.510 --> 00:11:43.390
No can do.

00:11:44.260 --> 00:11:48.890
Looks like I arrived too early and no one's here yet.

00:11:48.890 --> 00:11:52.270
Guess that means I can show myself with no worries.

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.360
Milly.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.940
Good morning.

00:11:55.940 --> 00:12:01.530
It's really rare to see sleepyhead Milly to come to school so early in the morning.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:03.410
What happened?

00:12:03.410 --> 00:12:07.910
Silica. I just felt like a change of pace.

00:12:07.910 --> 00:12:10.080
But you're wearing a school uniform...

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:12.170
You don't know, do you?

00:12:12.170 --> 00:12:12.920
What?

00:12:12.920 --> 00:12:14.880
Sign: Winter Break. Closed.

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:14.880
Starting today, it's winter break.

00:12:15.960 --> 00:12:19.840
Useless... piece of...

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:26.050
Welcome, welcome!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:29.520
Come and buy our scrumptious Christmas cakes!

00:12:29.520 --> 00:12:35.860
We have fresh cream, chocolate, and fruit cake, and there are many more options as well!

00:12:35.860 --> 00:12:41.030
Add 500 yen and you'll receive this cute girl's smile!

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:44.780
As if anyone will fall for that scam, cheapskate!

00:12:46.660 --> 00:12:49.740
What did I say about the manhandling...

00:12:49.740 --> 00:12:52.660
Idiot! Now look, shithead!

00:12:52.660 --> 00:12:54.750
What is it?

00:12:55.380 --> 00:12:57.420
That's...

00:12:57.420 --> 00:13:00.420
We're needed! Let's go, slowpoke!

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:02.670
Wait for me!

00:13:22.820 --> 00:13:26.490
It's Magical Girl Sweety Milly, idiot!

00:13:32.040 --> 00:13:34.120
How does it feel, Milly?

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:40.250
It's so tight!

00:13:40.250 --> 00:13:43.760
What's with you?! Where did the spirit of a magical girl of love go?!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.090
Get out of that and kick her ass, you piece of...

00:13:45.090 --> 00:13:49.680
The presents of this holy night belong to me now!

00:13:49.680 --> 00:13:52.520
Regardless of who you are,

00:13:52.520 --> 00:13:55.440
you'll shiver and cry yourself to sleep this night!

00:13:55.440 --> 00:14:00.110
For Silica Clause will only deliver loneliness and misfortune to your stockings!

00:14:00.110 --> 00:14:02.820
Merry Evil Christmas!

00:14:04.780 --> 00:14:08.820
I won't let that kind of Christmas be a reality!

00:14:08.820 --> 00:14:11.160
Present, huh?

00:14:11.160 --> 00:14:13.120
What should I do?

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.870
Plug.

00:14:17.920 --> 00:14:19.000
Plug!

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.710
What is it?

00:14:20.710 --> 00:14:22.460
Don't give me that.

00:14:22.460 --> 00:14:24.800
Aren't you supposed to be checking for charging targets?!

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:26.260
S-Sorry!

00:14:26.260 --> 00:14:29.180
Honestly, we're already extremely busy.

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:31.970
Don't make me clean up every blunder you make.

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:36.430
Those are cute!

00:14:36.430 --> 00:14:38.900
Really? I think they'll look good on you!

00:14:38.900 --> 00:14:40.480
So buy them!

00:14:40.980 --> 00:14:42.320
Hey, Alesta.

00:14:42.320 --> 00:14:43.530
What now?

00:14:43.530 --> 00:14:48.200
Hypothetically, what if someone gives a present to a person she has an uncertain relationship with?

00:14:48.200 --> 00:14:49.820
Uncertain relationship?

00:14:49.820 --> 00:14:52.240
One that isn't family or a lover.

00:14:52.240 --> 00:14:55.410
Simply put, having no relationship with that person.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:15:01.330
In the parallel world, giving presents to each other on festive occasions is quite normal.

00:15:01.790 --> 00:15:04.380
That's right, you're with the closed-minded crowd.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:06.510
Just forget all that weird stuff I said.

00:15:07.090 --> 00:15:09.340
You're misunderstanding something.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:12.300
Misunderstanding what?

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:15.310
I never said giving presents is wrong.

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:19.770
It's the act of giving your present to that special someone that counts.

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:20.850
Seriously?!

00:15:20.850 --> 00:15:22.440
Of course it is.

00:15:22.440 --> 00:15:26.280
Being from Life Core or from this world doesn't change that.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.700
Alesta!

00:15:29.150 --> 00:15:31.740
Presents aren't just material things!

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:36.830
They represent heartfelt feelings of appreciation toward someone else!

00:15:37.200 --> 00:15:40.290
That is why I won't allow you to trample on their emotions!

00:15:40.290 --> 00:15:43.080
You tell her! Even if you're a pathetic third-rate actress...

00:15:43.080 --> 00:15:45.250
...who can't even sell Christmas cakes properly,

00:15:45.250 --> 00:15:48.260
tonight, you're the Santa Clause for the good people!

00:15:49.380 --> 00:15:51.970
You flat-chested pest, acting all high and mighty!

00:15:51.970 --> 00:15:54.510
I'll send you to hell as a present!

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:58.350
But Mistress Silica, you used magic to increase your bust size...

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:02.730
Long live Mistress Silica!

00:16:05.110 --> 00:16:07.440
Yesterday's friend, today's enemy!

00:16:07.440 --> 00:16:09.400
Let's shake hands!

00:16:09.400 --> 00:16:11.610
Magical Girl Sweety Milly!

00:16:11.610 --> 00:16:15.660
Divine punishment is on its way!

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:21.000
I see now! Giving sincere thanks to a person,

00:16:21.000 --> 00:16:22.420
that's the best gift of all!

00:16:22.420 --> 00:16:24.250
Just like what Milly said!

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:29.210
I feel so much better now! Thanks, Alesta!

00:16:29.210 --> 00:16:34.800
No... Like I've been saying, this isn't the time to get weird all of a sudden...

00:16:34.800 --> 00:16:36.100
We still have to work.

00:16:36.100 --> 00:16:38.720
Yes sir, I'll go work my hardest today!

00:16:38.720 --> 00:16:40.060
Warp one, engage!

00:16:40.060 --> 00:16:41.810
You never listen, you idiot!

00:16:44.270 --> 00:16:46.810
What present?

00:16:50.990 --> 00:16:53.820
Target sighted at 4 o'clock!

00:16:53.820 --> 00:16:55.110
Roger!

00:16:56.410 --> 00:16:57.160
Damn!

00:16:57.410 --> 00:17:00.790
Neodym Charging Agent 4th Class, Grape Hugmoon!

00:17:00.790 --> 00:17:03.410
We're detaining you on suspicion of electricity theft!

00:17:03.410 --> 00:17:05.040
Bitches!

00:17:06.630 --> 00:17:08.340
This one doesn't listen.

00:17:30.440 --> 00:17:34.150
Other than theft, carrying arms and showing violent behavior...

00:17:34.150 --> 00:17:36.360
...are serious felonies.

00:17:37.910 --> 00:17:40.830
I thought you had us that time.

00:17:40.830 --> 00:17:44.830
Dodging that at point-blank... you're not human.

00:17:44.830 --> 00:17:46.620
That's an exaggeration.

00:17:46.960 --> 00:17:50.340
Please let me go, I did it all for my mother's hospital bills...

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:52.590
Is that so?

00:17:54.010 --> 00:17:58.430
Save your sob story for headquarters and your attorney.

00:17:58.430 --> 00:17:59.930
The only thing we're interested in...

00:17:59.930 --> 00:18:02.220
...are the facts.

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:14.440
It's still seven days till the next payday...

00:18:14.440 --> 00:18:17.490
...and there's very little left as it is...

00:18:18.740 --> 00:18:22.870
Milly's DVD Box set, Magical Battle Panties,

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:24.580
super limited edition!

00:18:25.160 --> 00:18:27.830
Wait, it's not something I want...

00:18:27.830 --> 00:18:31.380
Mistress Plug, you have 1 new mail.

00:18:31.380 --> 00:18:33.590
It's the catalogue of a new product!

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:35.170
Open it.

00:18:35.170 --> 00:18:36.760
By your command!

00:18:38.550 --> 00:18:40.800
What a pain...

00:18:41.760 --> 00:18:46.770
Doesn't look worth getting, but it'd be a shame not to earn the points.

00:18:55.900 --> 00:19:05.040
In the darkness of the night I saw something shining down the road. It was your shiny forehead.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:08.370
Please become my guide!

00:19:10.250 --> 00:19:12.630
Jingle Bells!

00:19:14.840 --> 00:19:16.380
Alesta Blanket.

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:18.510
A workaholic or a passionate love-struck wreck?

00:19:18.510 --> 00:19:21.970
Oh, the things her troubled heart must bear.

00:19:28.850 --> 00:19:30.480
Nice work, everyone.

00:19:43.160 --> 00:19:44.910
Rona Elmo.

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:49.410
I never thought the legendary Electricity Discharge Lady would turn out to be a young child like you.

00:19:49.710 --> 00:19:51.580
There's no need to be afraid.

00:19:51.580 --> 00:19:54.380
You must have had it tough from those unscrupulous opportunists.

00:19:55.130 --> 00:19:58.260
However, that doesn't change the situation.

00:19:58.260 --> 00:19:59.470
Do you understand?

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:02.680
Will you come along quietly?

00:20:02.680 --> 00:20:05.850
Or would you have us resort to using force?

00:20:10.310 --> 00:20:13.190
Was that a joke? What a bore.

00:20:13.190 --> 00:20:19.860
Go with you? Am I some criminal? Is that it? Don't mess with me.

00:20:19.860 --> 00:20:23.620
Where was I? Right, just die.

00:20:24.530 --> 00:20:25.580
Insulate!

00:20:50.770 --> 00:20:53.230
Resistance is futile, little one.

00:20:53.230 --> 00:20:55.020
Bye bye, old ladies.

00:21:08.830 --> 00:21:11.580
A fire? No, it's not...

00:21:12.750 --> 00:21:13.960
A Charging Lady?

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:15.540
Plug?

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:19.380
It doesn't matter how mundane the details are.

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:21.800
If you notice anything...

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:24.760
I should go check it out.

00:21:43.530 --> 00:21:45.820
What the hell is this?!

00:21:47.620 --> 00:21:48.620
You there...

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:52.540
You can see me?

00:21:58.920 --> 00:22:02.010
There's been a sudden blackout in the Sakuramoto area.

00:22:02.010 --> 00:22:04.840
The area is in chaos for the time being.

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:09.350
Even though the electricity supply is expected to be restored soon, the cause of it is still undetermined.

00:22:09.350 --> 00:22:11.100
Up next is entertainment news.

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:14.180
What's taking him so long?

00:22:11.100 --> 00:22:12.600
Is Hirano there?

00:22:12.600 --> 00:22:14.180
Yes, Hirano here!

00:22:14.480 --> 00:22:19.440
Fight! In one strike! Charge!

00:22:21.190 --> 00:22:23.990
I'm in my element tonight!

00:22:26.320 --> 00:22:28.620
Don't zone out, let's go to the next one!

00:22:28.620 --> 00:22:30.830
Aye aye, captain.

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:46.130
Honto wa totemo TOUGH nan da yo

00:22:42.670 --> 00:22:46.130
Really, I'm quite tough, you know

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:48.970
Hitori demo heiki de

00:22:46.130 --> 00:22:48.970
I'm fine even all by myself

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:51.720
Doko ni demo ikeru no

00:22:48.970 --> 00:22:51.720
I can go anywhere at all

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:54.470
Koibito nante iranai

00:22:51.720 --> 00:22:54.470
I don't need a boyfriend or anything

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:59.980
Takumashiku ikiteikunda to kimetetanda

00:22:54.470 --> 00:22:59.980
I decided that I would live strong

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:01.730
Kimi to deau made wa

00:22:59.980 --> 00:23:01.730
Until the day I could meet you

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:09.740
Sore wa arigachi na

00:23:06.990 --> 00:23:09.740
"That really is

00:23:09.740 --> 00:23:12.530
Warui kuse da yo

00:23:09.740 --> 00:23:12.530
It's a bad habit

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:15.330
Hanashi janai ka? nante

00:23:12.530 --> 00:23:15.330
such an often-heard saying, right?"

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:18.120
Toshiue buranaide ne

00:23:15.330 --> 00:23:18.120
Don't pretend to be older than you are

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:23.250
Datte ne watashi wa itsumo tokubetsu

00:23:18.120 --> 00:23:23.250
But you know, I'm always an exceptional case

00:23:23.630 --> 00:23:26.420
Kimi ni mo kitto SPECIAL deshou

00:23:23.630 --> 00:23:26.420
I'm sure I'm special to you, too

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.130
Sore de nakya iya

00:23:26.420 --> 00:23:28.130
I couldn't stand it any other way

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:31.970
Zettai watashi soba ni iru yo

00:23:28.470 --> 00:23:31.970
I'll definitely always be beside you

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:39.980
Kimi ga ochikondara namida fusegu kasa ni naritainda yo

00:23:31.970 --> 00:23:36.060
I want to become the umbrella

00:23:36.060 --> 00:23:39.980
that shields you from tears when you're feeling down

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:45.570
Keredo mamoreteru no wa naze ka watashi bakari

00:23:40.270 --> 00:23:42.900
But why is it that I'm the one

00:23:42.900 --> 00:23:45.570
who always ends up being protected?

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:51.820
Kimochi no naka no koishi ne tsumazuite korobisou na toki

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:51.820
At the times when, in my heart, I stumble and seem about to fall

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:56.580
Itsumo sotto sasaete kureru

00:23:52.070 --> 00:23:56.580
Keep supporting me just a little, always

00:23:56.950 --> 00:24:01.080
Futoshita kizuna itoshii yo

00:23:56.950 --> 00:24:01.080
I'll treasure this unexpected bond

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:02.420
Itsumademo

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:02.420
Now and forever

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:06.630
Eien Sweetheart

00:24:02.790 --> 00:24:06.630
Eternally, Sweetheart

00:24:10.950 --> 00:24:13.610
What's this? I have a bad feeling about this.

00:24:13.610 --> 00:24:16.150
Is this a premonition of something bad?

00:24:16.150 --> 00:24:17.510
Premonitions don't exist.

00:24:17.510 --> 00:24:18.290
Meow.

00:24:18.290 --> 00:24:20.720
Oh no! A black cat just passed by in front of me.

00:24:20.720 --> 00:24:22.740
Meow, meow, meow, meow.

00:24:22.740 --> 00:24:25.290
Oh no! More black cats have lined up!

00:24:25.290 --> 00:24:26.040
Meow.

00:24:26.040 --> 00:24:27.830
It's an army of misfortune!

00:24:27.830 --> 00:24:29.450
No, it's not, it's just an army of cats.

00:24:29.450 --> 00:24:31.040
So noisy of them!

00:24:31.040 --> 00:24:32.400
Sorry, meow.

00:24:32.400 --> 00:24:34.400
On the next episode of
Fight In one Strike! Charging Ladies!!:

00:24:33.530 --> 00:24:40.410
Beware! Electric Discharge Girl!

00:24:34.400 --> 00:24:36.220
Beware! Electric Discharge Girl!

00:24:36.220 --> 00:24:40.410
Sentou? Sentou? Sentou!
